<http://data.silknow.org/object/91823a48-8a7e-3ba8-8882-71211c08e8f0/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dragon robe with Buddhist attributes. Embroidered blue satin with design of sky, earth and water, nine large five-clawed dragons pursuing and clasping sacred discs among clouds and the eight Buddhist emblems of good augury. Embroidered in blue, green, white and yellow silks and gold thread in satin and Peking stitches and couched work on blue satin. Collar and cuffs have similar design on dark blue satin lined with pale blue satin."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/91823a48-8a7e-3ba8-8882-71211c08e8f0> .

